{
  "mdast": {
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "yaml",
        "value": "title: 'Under the hood'\nmetaTitle: 'Prisma under the hood'\nmetaDescription: 'Learn about Prisma internals and how it works \"under the hood\". Prisma tools are based on an engine-layer which manages the communication with the database.'"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Overview"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 2,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "This page gives an overview of the Prisma internals and how it works \"under the hood\"."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Note that "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "this page does not contain any practical information that is relevant for "
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "using"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "emphasis"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": " Prisma"
              }
            ],
            "type": "strong"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ". It rather aims at providing a "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "mental model"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " for what the Prisma toolkit "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "actually"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " is and how the different tools that are available to developers are structured."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "If you're new to Prisma, be sure to check out the "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Quickstart"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "../getting-started/quickstart"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " and "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Introduction"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "./introduction"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " pages first."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Modules and interfaces"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 2,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The tools in the Prisma toolkit are built with respect to two dimensions:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Module"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": A set of functionality that's offered by Prisma"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Interface"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": A way to "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "use"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " the functionality of a module"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          }
        ],
        "ordered": false,
        "spread": false,
        "start": null,
        "type": "list"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The following illustration gives an overview of the tools that exist (or are planned) in the Prisma toolkit:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "alt": "",
            "title": null,
            "type": "image",
            "url": "https://i.imgur.com/mxJTGOu.png"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Modules"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 3,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Prisma provides a number of features which are implemented in the form of "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "modules"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ". Here is an overview of the modules Prisma provides:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Query"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": Send queries to your database"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Migrate"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": Perform schema migrations in your database"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Introspect"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": Read a database schema and translate into "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Prisma data model"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": null,
                    "type": "link",
                    "url": "../reference/tools-and-interfaces/prisma-schema/data-model"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Schema"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": Construct and modify a "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Prisma schema file"
                      }
                    ],
                    "title": null,
                    "type": "link",
                    "url": "../reference/tools-and-interfaces/prisma-schema/prisma-schema-file"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Generate"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": Generate clients for Prisma data sources"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          }
        ],
        "ordered": false,
        "spread": false,
        "start": null,
        "type": "list"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Interface"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 3,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Interfaces"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " offer a way to actually "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "use"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " the functionality of a module. The module-interface-matrix above shows four different levels of interfaces (from bottom to top):"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Engines"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " Implements the "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "core functionality"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " consumed by the higher-level interfaces"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "Library"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": A way to "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "programmatically"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " use the functionality of a module"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "CLI"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": A way to use the functionality of a module on the "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "command line"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "emphasis"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "GUI"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "strong"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ": A way to "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "value": "visually"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "emphasis"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " use the functionality of a module"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          }
        ],
        "ordered": false,
        "spread": false,
        "start": null,
        "type": "list"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Prisma engines"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 2,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "At the core of each module, there typically is a "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Prisma engine"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " that implements the core set of functionality. Engines are implemented in "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Rust"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "https://www.rust-lang.org/"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " and expose a low-level API that is used by the higher-level interfaces."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A Prisma engine is the "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "direct interface to the database"
              }
            ],
            "type": "strong"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ", any higher-level interfaces always communicate with the database "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "through"
              }
            ],
            "type": "emphasis"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " the engine-layer."
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "As an example, Prisma Client connects to the "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "query engine"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "../reference/tools-and-interfaces/prisma-client/query-engine"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " in order to read and write data in a database:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "alt": "",
            "title": null,
            "type": "image",
            "url": "https://i.imgur.com/I8do25A.png"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Using custom engine binaries"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 3,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "By default, all binaries are automatically downloaded into the "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "node_modules/@prisma/cli"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " folder when you install or update "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "@prisma/cli"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ". You might want to use a "
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "custom binary"
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "type": "link",
            "url": "https://github.com/prisma/prisma-engines"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " file if:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Automated download of binaries is not possible."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "You have created your own engine binary (for testing, or for an OS that is not officially supported)."
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          }
        ],
        "ordered": false,
        "spread": false,
        "start": null,
        "type": "list"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Use the following environment variables to specify custom locations for your binaries:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "PRISMA_QUERY_ENGINE_BINARY"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " (Query engine)"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "PRISMA_MIGRATION_ENGINE_BINARY"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " (Migration engine)"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "PRISMA_INTROSPECTION_ENGINE_BINARY"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " (Introspection engine)"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "PRISMA_FMT_BINARY"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " (for "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "npx prisma format"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": ")"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "spread": false,
            "type": "listItem"
          }
        ],
        "ordered": false,
        "spread": false,
        "start": null,
        "type": "list"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "prisma/.env"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " file"
          }
        ],
        "depth": 4,
        "type": "heading"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "To set an environment variable in the "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineCode",
            "value": "prisma/.env"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " file:"
          }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Add the environment variable to the "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "prisma/.env"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " file:"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attributes": [
                  {
                    "name": "tabs",
                    "type": "mdxJsxAttribute",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "mdxJsxAttributeValueExpression",
                      "value": "[<FileWithIcon text=\"Unix, MacOS\" icon=\"code\"/>  , <FileWithIcon text=\"Windows\" icon=\"display\"/>]"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "attributes": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "lang": null,
                        "meta": null,
                        "type": "code",
                        "value": "PRISMA_QUERY_ENGINE_BINARY=custom/path/my-query-engine-binary"
                      }
                    ],
                    "name": "tab",
                    "type": "mdxJsxFlowElement"
                  },
                  {
                    "attributes": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "lang": null,
                        "meta": null,
                        "type": "code",
                        "value": "PRISMA_QUERY_ENGINE_BINARY=c:\\custom\\path\\my-query-engine-binary"
                      }
                    ],
                    "name": "tab",
                    "type": "mdxJsxFlowElement"
                  }
                ],
                "name": "TabbedContent",
                "type": "mdxJsxFlowElement"
              }
            ],
            "spread": true,
            "type": "listItem"
          },
          {
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Run the following command to output the paths to all binaries:"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "lang": "terminal",
                "meta": null,
                "type": "code",
                "value": "npx prisma -v"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "The output shows that the query engine path comes from the "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "inlineCode",
                    "value": "PRISMA_QUERY_ENGINE_BINARY"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": " environment variable:"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attributes": [
                  {
                    "name": "tabs",
                    "type": "mdxJsxAttribute",
                    "value": {
                      "type": "mdxJsxAttributeValueExpression",
                      "value": "[<FileWithIcon text=\"Unix, MacOS\" icon=\"code\"/>  , <FileWithIcon text=\"Windows\" icon=\"display\"/>]"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "attributes": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "lang": null,
                        "meta": null,
                        "type": "code",
                        "value": "Current platform     : darwin\n|Query Engine         : query-engine d6ff7119649922b84e413b3b69660e2f49e2ddf3 (at /custom/my-query-engine-windows)\nMigration Engine     : migration-engine-cli d6ff7119649922b84e413b3b69660e2f49e2ddf3 (at /myproject/node_modules/@prisma/cli/migration-engine-windows)\nIntrospection Engine : introspection-core d6ff7119649922b84e413b3b69660e2f49e2ddf3 (at /myproject/node_modules/@prisma/cli/introspection-engine-windows)\nFormat Binary        : prisma-fmt d6ff7119649922b84e413b3b69660e2f49e2ddf3 (at /myproject/node_modules/@prisma/cli/prisma-fmt-windows)"
                      }
                    ],
                    "name": "tab",
                    "type": "mdxJsxFlowElement"
                  },
                  {
                    "attributes": [],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "lang": null,
